<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Does ARC Raiders use AI? · Disclosure &amp; evidence | Game AI Checker</title><meta name="description" content="Does ARC Raiders use AI? — Official AI disclosure. Read developer disclosures, eight AI-use areas, dated sources and review limits."><meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large"><link rel="canonical" href="https://gameaichecker.com/games/1808500-arc-raiders/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://gameaichecker.com/games/1808500-arc-raiders/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="zh-CN" href="https://gameaichecker.com/games/zh-cn/1808500-arc-raiders/"><link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://gameaichecker.com/games/1808500-arc-raiders/"><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg"><meta property="og:title" content="Does ARC Raiders use AI?"><meta property="og:description" content="Does ARC Raiders use AI? — Official AI disclosure. Read developer disclosures, eight AI-use areas, dated sources and review limits."><meta property="og:url" content="https://gameaichecker.com/games/1808500-arc-raiders/"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:image" content="https://gameaichecker.com/images/steam/apps/1808500/4dd7766da5284c87-full.webp?v=gallery1"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Does ARC Raiders use AI?","url":"https://gameaichecker.com/games/1808500-arc-raiders/","inLanguage":"en","description":"Does ARC Raiders use AI? — Official AI disclosure. Read developer disclosures, eight AI-use areas, dated sources and review limits.","dateModified":"2026-10-27","about":{"@type":"VideoGame","name":"ARC Raiders","sameAs":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1808500/","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Embark Studios"}}}</script><style>:root{font-f