</style></head><body> <header><div class="bar"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/logo.svg" alt="">Game AI Checker</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/browse/">Games</a><a href="/guides/how-to-check-steam-game-ai/">How to check</a><a href="https://gameaichecker.com/games/zh-cn/1808500-arc-raiders/" lang="zh-CN">中文</a></nav></div></header> <main><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/browse/">Games</a> / ARC Raiders</div> <section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">AI DISCLOSURE CHECK · STEAM APP 1808500</div><h1>Does ARC Raiders use AI?</h1><div class="answer"><strong>Official AI disclosure</strong><p>The developer has disclosed AI use. Read the original wording below for its scope; this is a developer statement, not an independent audit.</p><details style="margin-top:14px"><summary>Review summary</summary><p>ARC Raiders has a broad official Steam AI disclosure that does not specify asset types. Separately, interviews report actor-licensed text-to-speech and later partial voice-line replacement; those reports are attributed rather than inferred from the store wording.</p></details><p>The disclosure does not identify the asset types. No specific area is inferred.</p></div><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#disclosure">Read the evidence</a><a class="button secondary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/1808500/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam store ↗</a></div><dl class="facts"><div><dt>Developer</dt><dd>Embark Studios</dd></div><div><dt>Last reviewed</dt><dd>2026-10-27</dd></div></dl></div><div class="hero-media"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/4dd7766da5284c87.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — official Steam image" fetchpriority="high"><p class="muted">Official Steam imagery. Rights belong to the respective owners.</p></div></section> <section class="section" id="areas"><h2>Eight areas, separate answers</h2><p class="muted">“Not stated” means the reviewed evidence does not settle that area. Open a card for the recorded note.</p><div class="grid"><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>In-game generation<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>Code<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>Art<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>Music &amp; sound<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>Voice<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>Writing<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>Translation<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details><details data-state="not_stated"><summary>Marketing<small>Not stated</small></summary><div class="note"><b>Review note</b><p>The reviewed sources do not establish an explicit conclusion for this area. Absence of a disclosure is not proof of no use.</p></div><a href="#sources">Check original sources ↓</a></details></div></section> <section class="section" id="disclosure"><h2>Original disclosure</h2><p class="muted">Developer wording, preserved in its original language. Store wording can change after the review date.</p><blockquote lang="en">During the development process, we may use procedural- and AI-based tools to assist with content creation. In all such cases, the final product reflects the creativity and expression of our own development team.</blockquote></section> <section class="section" id="sources"><h2>Sources &amp; review limits</h2><p class="muted">Official statements and community allegations are kept separate. Source excerpts and original review notes retain their original language.</p><div class="sources"><details><summary>Official disclosure · 1<small>2026-10-27 · store.steampowered.com</small></summary><div class="source-top"><span class="pill">Official disclosure</span><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/1808500/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original source ↗</a></div><p lang="zh-CN">Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</p><blockquote lang="en">During the development process, we may use procedural- and AI-based tools to assist with content creation. In all such cases, the final product reflects the creativity and expression of our own development team.</blockquote></details><details><summary>Steam discussion index · 2<small>2026-10-27 · steamcommunity.com</small></summary><div class="source-top"><span class="pill">Steam discussion index</span><a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/1808500/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original source ↗</a></div><p lang="zh-CN">Steam 讨论区首页核查</p><blockquote lang="zh-CN">英文讨论区首页显示 15 个主题（总数 1847）；仅覆盖首页。</blockquote></details><details><summary>Third-party source · 3<small>2026-10-27 · www.pcgamesn.com</small></summary><div class="source-top"><span class="pill">Third-party source</span><a href="https://www.pcgamesn.com/arc-raiders/generative-ai-use" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original source ↗</a></div><p lang="en">Public reporting / reference</p><blockquote lang="en">PCGamesN interviews design director Virgil Watkins about licensed actor-based text-to-speech for the ping system, while distinguishing that use from the game’s visuals.</blockquote></details><details><summary>Third-party source · 4<small>2026-10-27 · www.gamespot.com</small></summary><div class="source-top"><span class="pill">Third-party source</span><a href="https://www.gamespot.com/articles/arc-raiders-now-has-fewer-ai-voices-as-dev-re-recorded-lines-amid-controversy/1100-6538780/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original source ↗</a></div><p lang="en">Public reporting / reference</p><blockquote lang="en">GameSpot reports that some synthetic voice lines were re-recorded after launch. This describes a partial replacement, not removal of every AI-assisted voice line.</blockquote></details><details><summary>Third-party source · 5<small>2026-10-27 · www.pcgamer.com</small></summary><div class="source-top"><span class="pill">Third-party source</span><a href="https://www.pcgamer.com/gaming-industry/arc-raiders-use-of-ai-highlights-the-tension-and-confusion-over-where-machine-learning-ends-and-generative-ai-begins/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original source ↗</a></div><p lang="en">Public reporting / reference</p><blockquote lang="en">PC Gamer discusses the difference between the broad Steam disclosure, text-to-speech voices and machine learning for animation. These are attributed reports, kept separate from the store-based area classification.</blockquote></details></div><details style="margin-top:14px"><summary>Review notes &amp; coverage limits</summary><p>Checked the full-game Steam identity and complete store page, the English discussion homepage and any related visible first-page threads, plus a separate per-game web search. This is not a full historical or multilingual audit. Search limitations and source scope are recorded with the evidence. No disclosure does not mean no AI use. The official wording does not identify asset types, so all eight areas remain not stated. Third-party interviews discuss text-to-speech and subsequent partial replacement; those reports do not expand the scope of the official store disclosure.</p></details><p class="help">Community posts can raise questions but do not establish an official AI-use finding. A forum homepage check is not a review of every historical post or every language.</p><a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Correction%3A%20ARC%20Raiders%20(1808500)&body=Page%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F1808500-arc-raiders%2F%0A%0ACorrection%3A%0A%0AOriginal%20source%20and%20date%3A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a correction with a dated source ↗</a></section> <section class="section"><h2>Official gallery</h2><div class="gallery"><a href="/images/steam/apps/1808500/20a535caa191d61b-full.webp?v=gallery1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/20a535caa191d61b-thumb.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — Steam screenshot 1" loading="lazy"></a><a href="/images/steam/apps/1808500/35a6e6bc085b42b0-full.webp?v=gallery1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/35a6e6bc085b42b0-thumb.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — Steam screenshot 2" loading="lazy"></a><a href="/images/steam/apps/1808500/7ee2c6e047b28fa0-full.webp?v=gallery1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/7ee2c6e047b28fa0-thumb.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — Steam screenshot 3" loading="lazy"></a><a href="/images/steam/apps/1808500/5efdb6e74b9fe985-full.webp?v=gallery1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/5efdb6e74b9fe985-thumb.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — Steam screenshot 4" loading="lazy"></a><a href="/images/steam/apps/1808500/bc46903246321af5-full.webp?v=gallery1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/bc46903246321af5-thumb.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — Steam screenshot 5" loading="lazy"></a><a href="/images/steam/apps/1808500/58535fc6e3b6eb0c-full.webp?v=gallery1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/58535fc6e3b6eb0c-thumb.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — Steam screenshot 6" loading="lazy"></a><a href="/images/steam/apps/1808500/2403423a8ddb1b30-full.webp?v=gallery1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="/images/steam/apps/1808500/2403423a8ddb1b30-thumb.webp?v=gallery1" alt="ARC Raiders — Steam screenshot 7" loading="lazy"></a></div></section> <section class="section help"><h2>Check another Steam game</h2><p>Search by game name, Steam App ID or store URL. Read the scope of the evidence before drawing a conclusion.</p><a class="button" href="/">Search games</a> <a class="button secondary" href="/guides/how-to-check-steam-game-ai/">How to check AI use</a></section> </main><footer>Game AI Checker · Sources and review dates, not an AI detector. <a href="https://gameaichecker.com/games/zh-cn/1808500-arc-raiders/" lang="zh-CN">中文</a></footer> </body></html>